  "rationale": "With the four defences in place, every route to crownData:exfiltrate is cut. The target is an OR of vaultRead, codeRepo, shareMount and dbReplica, and each fails: (1) codeRepo:collection is blocked directly. (2) shareMount:collection depends only on backupHost:lateralMovement, which is blocked. (3) dbReplica:collection needs one of serviceAccount, domainAdmin or monitoringHost. serviceAccount is an AND that needs vpnSession:authenticate, itself an AND requiring the blocked ciRunner:exploitPublicApp. domainAdmin is an AND that needs dbLogin:authenticate (requires the blocked browserStore:credentialAccess) and apiToken:authenticate (requires the blocked ciRunner). monitoringHost depends only on rdpLogin:authenticate, an AND requiring the blocked browserStore. (4) vaultRead:collection needs domainAdmin or serviceAccount, both shown unreachable. So the target is unreachable."
